
C-8K FOCAL @1969

20.01 T "ONE ARMED BANDIT - PDP-8 STYLE" !
20.02 T "  BAR    BAR    BAR   PAYS $1000 JACKPOT!" !
20.03 T " BELL   BELL   BELL   PAYS $500" !
20.04 T "GRAPEF GRAPEF GRAPEF  PAYS $200" !
