22.09 I (A(1)-5) 22.22,22.20,22.10
22.10 I (A(1)-7) 22.20,22.20,22.22
22.11 I (A(1)-5) 22.22,22.21,22.22
22.12 T "JACKPOT!!!! PAY $1000" ; S R=R+1000; R
22.13 T "PAY $500" ! ; S R=R+500 ; R
